# Copy this file to ~/.config/brain/publish-denylist and replace every sample line.
# One term per line. A line starting with # is a comment.
# A term matches a whole word. A term ending in "-" is a case-sensitive prefix (a ticket key).
# Categories to cover: employer, client names, ticket prefixes, your name, email, phone,
# home folder, internal hostnames, key patterns.
# The three SAMPLE lines below are not real. Delete them. Publish refuses a denylist that still has them.

SAMPLE-EMPLOYER
SAMPLE-CLIENT
SAMPLE-NAME
